{"id":"4ddc297472634c04","group":"89","path":"89/89-prop-converse-wf-transitive.md","title":"Converse Well-founded Does Not Imply Transitive","display":"prop-converse-wf-transitive — Converse Well-founded Does Not Imply Transitive","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-prop-converse-wf-transitive","aliases":["89-prop-converse-wf-transitive"],"display":"prop-converse-wf-transitive — Converse Well-founded Does Not Imply Transitive","depends_on":["[[89-df-converse-well-founded]]","[[89-df-transitive-frame]]","[[89-df-kripke-frame]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-prop-converse-wf-transitive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-prop-converse-wf-transitive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-converse-wf-transitive — Converse Well-founded Does Not Imply Transitive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae4d761acfb9353d\" href=\"?note=ae4d761acfb9353d\" title=\"89-df-converse-well-founded\">89-df-converse-well-founded</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c02ba5095698c09\" href=\"?note=5c02ba5095698c09\" title=\"89-df-transitive-frame\">89-df-transitive-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\coloneqq\\{0,1,2\\}\">\\(W\\coloneqq\\{0,1,2\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\coloneqq\\{(0,1),(1,2)\\}\">\\(R\\coloneqq\\{(0,1),(1,2)\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\\coloneqq(W,R)\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\coloneqq(W,R)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)\\)</span> is converse well-foundedness and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> is frame transitivity.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}converse\\text{-}wf\\text{-}transitive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)\n\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}converse\\text{-}wf\\text{-}transitive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)\n\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> : 可达关系</li>\n<li>逆良基性本身不蕴含传递性；GL 框架必须分别要求二者</li>\n<li>模态语义的重要性质</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-converse-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"ae4d761acfb9353d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-converse-well-founded]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-transitive-frame","status":"resolved","id":"5c02ba5095698c09","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-transitive-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W\\coloneqq\\{0,1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\coloneqq\\{(0,1),(1,2)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}\\coloneqq(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}converse\\text{-}wf\\text{-}transitive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)\n\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F).","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":958,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["ae4d761acfb9353d","5c02ba5095698c09","c78d4bf1505bda5c"]}